WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit with legs extended straight, feet flexed, toes pointing up.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Root the sitting bones and lengthen the spine tall.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Place the hands beside the hips, fingers pointing forward.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Draw the low belly in gently and soften the shoulders.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Stay for several breaths, then transition to your next seated pose.
